<link rel="stylesheet" href="stylesheets/volunteer.css">

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="page-main-with-hero">
    <!-- Match the Reports page hero structure so the image sits above the content row. -->
    <section class="page-hero-top volunteer-hero-top" aria-label="Volunteer page hero image">
        <img src="images/2024/06/corporate-volunteer.jpg" alt="Volunteers assembling birthing kits">
    </section>

    <div class="page-body-with-sidebar">
        <%- include('partials/getInvolvedSideMenu') %>

        <div class="page-content our-history-page volunteer-page-content">

            <!-- Brief overview followed by the main ways visitors can volunteer. -->
            <section class="history-text-section">
                <h1>VOLUNTEER</h1>
                <p>The support of our volunteers is essential in helping to manage our work in Australia.</p>
                <p>You can get involved by organising an Assembly Day at your workplace, school, or home, or attending an existing event listed below.</p>
                <p>Volunteers may also undertake fundraising activities and advocate on behalf of BKFA. The BKFA Board of Directors all undertake their roles on a voluntary basis.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="volunteer-cta-section">
                <div class="volunteer-cta-grid">
                    <!-- Link volunteer CTAs to their dedicated Volunteer subpages. -->
                    <a href="/volunteer/hostanassemblyday" class="vol-cta-band">
                        <h3>PACK KITS</h3>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/volunteer/corporate-volunteering" class="vol-cta-band">
                        <h3>CORPORATE VOLUNTEERING</h3>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/volunteer/kitsathome" class="vol-cta-band">
                        <h3>KITS AT HOME</h3>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>

        <section class="history-text-section">
            <h2>How can I get involved?</h2>

            <!-- Highlight the assembly-day PDF and email so volunteers can act from this sentence. -->
            <p>If you’re interested in volunteering at an Assembly Day near you, please have a look in the <a href="/documents/Upcoming-AD-Listing-May-June-2026.pdf" class="volunteer-inline-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">upcoming assembly day listing</a>. This is updated regularly, so be sure to keep looking if there isn’t one near you at this stage. If you see one that suits, contact <a href="mailto:info@bkfa.org.au" class="volunteer-inline-link">info@bkfa.org.au</a></p>
        </section>

